# LAST AISLE - characters.art
# Hand-authored top-down character sprites. Torsos face RIGHT (+x), pivot = canvas centre.
# Grips: *_1h right hand (18,16), *_2h grip (17,13) + support hand ~(21,11)-(22,12);
# boss (32x32): 1h (24,22), 2h (23,17).
# Light from top-left, 1px dark outline (0).

