# ---------------------------------------------------------------- THE CREW
# The Greenhouse's own: the player's camp gear (hoodie, olive pack) in their own colours. Torsos are swaps of the player;
# the dead are swaps of hollis_dead, whose neck stump keeps its blood (the jacket is z/J/j there, not r/R/x).
@swap hollis_idle player_idle rz RJ xj
@swap hollis_1h player_1h rz RJ xj
@swap hollis_2h player_2h rz RJ xj
@swap hollis_punch player_punch rz RJ xj
@swap hollis_down player_down rz RJ xj
@swap legs_hollis legs_player
@frames hollis_dead 3 32 32
